1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,340
Yeah, I'm walkin' this road at a mile an hour (mile an hour)

2
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:10,580
Ain't got the speed... but Lord, I got the power (I got the power)

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,860
Leavin' footprints of gold on the road I've known

4
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:20,260
So nobody walkin' slow has to walk alone

5
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:24,660
Slow ain't stoppin'... no, slow ain't gone

6
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:29,460
I woke up this mornin'... so I'm movin' on

7
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,220
(A mile an hour) A mile an hour...

8
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,092
Still walkin' on

9
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,740
Who's worth goin' through hell for?

10
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,380
Find 'em. Hold 'em close.

11
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,340
And walk

12
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,740
A mile an hour

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,340
A mile an hour...

14
00:00:58,340 --> 00:01:01,140
Still walkin' on...
